              "tool_use_id": "toolu_01FY63MahW768VoWLcRPEDwP",
              "type": "tool_result",
              "content": "437:\\label{prop:lambda_bound}\n481:\\item \\textbf{Proportional} ($f=\\lambda_0\\,g$, $\\lambda_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\!\\setminus\\!\\{0\\}$): $\\lambda(C)\\in[0,1]$ in \\emph{all} $30{,}000$ trials (pooled observed range $[1.2{\\times}10^{-5},\\,0.850]$; zero out-of-bounds), confirming the closed-form bound. Sign preservation of $\\hat\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}}$ therefore reduces to $\\operatorname{sign}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}})=\\operatorname{sign}(\\tau_{\\mathrm{total}})$.\n484:The diagnostic $\\lambda_V(C)$ lies in $[0,1]$ across all $30{,}000$ trials irrespective of regime, as guaranteed by the law of total variance. The script and full results are in \\texttt{artifacts/verify\\_lambda\\_bound.py} and \\texttt{artifacts/verify\\_lambda\\_bound\\_results.json}."
            }
